g to you?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Question","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["humour","boundaries"]},{"id":"SM-000032","text":"Have you ever met someone for a short chat and ended up talking for hours? What kept it going?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Story starter","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["conversation","chemistry"]},{"id":"SM-000033","text":"Matching playlists or completely different music tastes with plenty to recommend?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Quick choice","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["music","shared interests"]},{"id":"SM-000034","text":"Every circle seems to have a person who translates confusing plans into one clear message. Is that you?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Casual observation","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["planning","group dynamics"]},{"id":"SM-000035","text":"What's one thing someone does at the start of a visit that makes you relax?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Question","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["hospitality","comfort"]},{"id":"SM-000036","text":"You and someone are choosing a film, and every suggestion gets a polite 'anything is fine'. How do you settle it?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Scenario","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["movies","decisions"]},{"id":"SM-000037","text":"Which ordinary place feels special because of who you usually go there with?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Question","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["shared places","memories"]},{"id":"SM-000038","text":"I want to hear about a conversation you started because you both noticed something funny nearby.","topic":"Relationships","format":"Story starter","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["serendipity","humour"]},{"id":"SM-000039","text":"Remembering important dates or remembering tiny details from everyday conversations?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Quick choice","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["memory","attention"]},{"id":"SM-000040","text":"The first person to start packing up after a hangout often triggers everyone else. Who starts the exit in your group?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Casual observation","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["goodbyes","group habits"]},{"id":"SM-000041","text":"What's a sign someone enjoys your company without needing to say it outright?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Question","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["companionship","signals"]},{"id":"SM-000042","text":"A sincere 'I don't know, tell me more' keeps people close better than pretending to know everything. Thoughts?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Hot take","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["listening","curiosity"]},{"id":"SM-000043","text":"You're sharing an umbrella on a rainy Lagos afternoon. Do you walk faster to stay dry or slow down and enjoy the chat?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Scenario","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["Lagos weather","conversation"]},{"id":"SM-000044","text":"What's the funniest misunderstanding you've had over the tone of a text message?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Question","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["texting","miscommunication"]},{"id":"SM-000045","text":"Tell me about someone who introduced you to a food you now order on your own.","topic":"Relationships","format":"Story starter","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["food","influence"]},{"id":"SM-000046","text":"A friend who remembers to take photos or one who helps you forget your phone for a while?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Quick choice","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["photographs","presence"]},{"id":"SM-000047","text":"People have different versions of 'come over anytime'. How literal is yours?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Casual observation","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["hospitality","boundaries"]},{"id":"SM-000048","text":"When someone visits, what little detail tells you they've been paying attention to your home?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Question","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["home","attention"]},{"id":"SM-000049","text":"A good relationship includes being able t