 warm without turning it into a thirty-minute second conversation?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Question","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["goodbyes","affection"]},{"id":"SM-000062","text":"People who send photos of things that remind them of you have mastered casual thoughtfulness. Agree?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Hot take","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["photos","thoughtfulness"]},{"id":"SM-000063","text":"A person you haven't seen in ages remembers your exact favourite biscuit. Do you find it sweet or slightly hilarious?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Scenario","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["memory","food"]},{"id":"SM-000064","text":"What have you learned about someone through the way they plan a day out?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Question","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["planning","personalities"]},{"id":"SM-000065","text":"Have you ever adopted an expression from someone you spend time with? Which one?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Story starter","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["language","influence"]},{"id":"SM-000066","text":"Cooking together with a messy kitchen or ordering in and enjoying a spotless one?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Quick choice","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["cooking","quality time"]},{"id":"SM-000067","text":"Some friendships have a designated storyteller who retells the same event differently every time. Do you know one?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Casual observation","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["storytelling","humour"]},{"id":"SM-000068","text":"What's a harmless habit of yours people tend to notice before you do?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Question","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["quirks","self-awareness"]},{"id":"SM-000069","text":"Being able to change plans without anyone taking offence is a quiet sign of comfort. Do you agree?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Hot take","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["flexibility","comfort"]},{"id":"SM-000070","text":"Your companion wants to leave a party exactly when the best song comes on. What's your compromise?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Scenario","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["parties","music"]},{"id":"SM-000071","text":"How do you tell someone you're enjoying their company without making it a big moment?","topic":"Relationships","format":"Question","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["appreciation","communication"]},{"id":"SM-000072","text":"Has a journey with someone ever turned out to be more memorable than the destination? Tell me what happened.","topic":"Relationships","format":"Story starter","moods":["Chill"],"audiences":["Anyone"],"angles":[],"adult":false,"editorialStatus":"approved","source":"published-library","relatedThemes":["travel","conversation"]},{"id":"SM-000073","text":"A little 